  "bodyHash": "effe1523e3cf092e",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:60px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2274\" height=\"749\"></p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote style=\"padding-left:20px;font-style:italic;color:#666\">\n<p>&laquo;厌倦了《我的世界》基本的用户界面？受够了走近附魔台，却只看到与工作台一样的灰色菜单？想要为你的游戏增添一些色彩吗？</p>\n<p>隆重推出彩色容器！一款旨在为《我的世界》中所有色彩斑斓的可交互方块匹配专属菜单的容器 GUI 替换模组。&raquo;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:normal\">而现在，我带来了一个完全<strong>重</strong>制、<strong>重</strong>纹理化、<strong>重</strong>构想象的版本 —— <strong><span style=\"color:#d32927\">R</span><span style=\"color:#e66826\">e</span><span style=\"color:#ec9222\">c</span><span style=\"color:#eab718\">o</span><span style=\"color:#cbd541\">l</span><span style=\"color:#86e441\">o</span><span style=\"color:#7bd6c8\">u</span><span style=\"color:#419be5\">r</span><span style=\"color:#3777e0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#8665e0\">u</span><span style=\"color:#c76ee4\">l </span>Containers（彩色容器）</strong>，支持新版本，拥有全新纹理和更多的沉浸感！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">所有 GUI 都受到了其所关联方块的启发而进行了更改。修复了原版《我的世界》纹理的问题，更改了 HUD，甚至在原版中也加入了动画 GUI，以及更多<strong>更多</strong>内容！</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><strong>已更改纹理的图形：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>已更改纹理列表：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>铁砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>制图台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石机&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>锻造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投掷器、发射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔炉、高炉、烟熏炉&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>带箱子的船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>带箱子的矿车</li>\n<li>鹦鹉螺壳和僵尸鹦鹉螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品栏</li>\n<li>配方书</li>\n<li>书</li>\n<li>信标</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>经验条&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>一些小的 UI 更改和修复</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 功能</strong> （请阅读“安装指南”以获取更多信息）<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>带有职业信息的村民 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>末影箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡子、驴、羊驼</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>带有所有类型和职业组合的村民 GUI <em>(OptiGUI 独占)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(Animatica 独占)</em></li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>圣诞箱子</li>\n<li>带有变体的铜箱子 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡子、驴（带箱子和不带箱子 - <em>OptiGUI 独占</em>）</li>\n<li>羊驼（带有地毯颜色）</li>\n<li>受损的铁砧 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>已书写的书 <em>(OptiGUI+Animatica 独占)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>讲台上的书 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模组支持：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>配饰 (Accessories)</li>\n<li>盔甲变色 (Armor Chroma)</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>背部槽位 (Backslot) <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>不死护符 (Charm of Undying) <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>更好的附魔 (Better Enchanting)</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>详细盔甲条 (Detail Armor Bar)</li>\n<li>物品交换器 (ItemSwapper)</li>\n<li>语言重载 (Language Reload)</li>\n<li>模组菜单 (Mod Menu)</li>\n<li>递归资源 (Recursive Resources)</li>\n<li>锯木厂 (Sawmill)</li>\n<li>他们在忙什么 (What Are They Up To)</li>\n<li>骑手 (Horseman)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">如果您想要完整的体验，需要安装 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine！</h3>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3>如果您不想使用 OptiGUI，或者仅使用 OptiFine 模组，您可以在语言设置中激活内置的 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 模式</h3>\n<p>如何激活：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需支持其他语言，请使用<strong>附加文件</strong>选项卡中的单独 VANILLA+ 包</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<p><strong>常见问题解答：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>问：我可以去哪里询问任何（不在此列表中的）问题？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>留下评论或加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">彩色 Discord 服务器</a>并在那里提问！</p>\n<p><strong>已知问题列表：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 时：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民职业不起作用</li>\n<li>木桶显示箱子 GUI 纹理</li>\n<li>带箱子的船显示上次访问过的类似箱子的容器 GUI 纹理</li>\n<li>某些马类实体不受支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您仅使用 OptiFine，建议使用 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 模式</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>使用 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span> 模式时：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>在 1.21.9+ 版本中，重命名后潜影盒不显示彩色 GUI</li>\n<li>潜影盒槽位高亮显示看起来奇怪 / 在某些版本中不显示</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>问：箱子/潜影盒/村民职业 GUI 不起作用！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>检查您是否安装了 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或者已将语言更改为 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">“原版+”</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：你能增加对 X 模组的支持吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>简短回答：理论上可以。请在评论区留下您的建议或在 Discord 中提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用彩色容器吗？/ 我可以修改彩色容器吗？/ 我可以对彩色容器做 X 操作吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>请参阅描述底部的使用条款</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我想支持你！我该怎么做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>关于这一点……</p>\n</div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果您不想提供服务器但仍然想支持我，<strong>请与你的朋友分享此包，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等平台上展示它！</strong>只需留下到此页面的链接，我会非常感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>别忘了点赞和关注以获取未来更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"54\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fchris_xeno%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 提供了他最初的彩色容器纹理包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 帮助编写自定义着色器代码，许多功能得益于他的帮助才得以实现</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kryqu/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kryqu</a></strong> 为村民 GUI 提供了灵感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><strong>使用条款：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>如果您认为您不能对此包进行某些操作，请先问我 :) </strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>将此包包含在免费整合包中</li>\n<li>将此包包含在您自己的私人服务器中</li>\n<li>修改此包（仅限个人使用）</li>\n<li>以任何形式的媒体使用此包，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未经我的同意，在任何平台以任何形式分发此包、其资产及修改后的资产</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
